# exit: 0
# stdout:
Print the knapsack version. It also checks for a newer release, and if
there is one, says so on stderr with how to update. Set KNAPSACK_NO_UPDATE_NOTIFIER
to skip the check.

Usage:
  knapsack version [flags]

Global Flags:
      --config string   use this config file instead of the default
  -v, --verbose         show progress and the underlying cause of errors
# stderr:
